class="text-base my-auto mx-auto [--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-xs,calc(var(--spacing)*4))] @w-sm/main:[--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-sm,calc(var(--spacing)*6))] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-lg,calc(var(--spacing)*16))] px-(--thread-content-margin)"><div data-conversation-screenshot-content="" class="[--thread-content-max-width:40rem] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-max-width:48rem] mx-auto max-w-(--thread-content-max-width) flex-1 group/turn-messages focus-visible:outline-hidden relative flex w-full min-w-0 flex-col agent-turn"><div class="flex max-w-full flex-col gap-4 grow"><div class="contents"><div class="contents"></div></div><div data-message-author-role="assistant" data-message-id="9dd94124-b974-43a2-ad76-0ced0f0ca9d4" dir="auto" data-message-model-slug="gpt-5-6" class="min-h-8 text-message relative flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 text-start break-words whitespace-normal outline-none keyboard-focused:focus-ring [.text-message+&amp;]:mt-1"><div class="flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden"><div class="LR5Y_W_content markdown prose dark:prose-invert wrap-break-word w-full dark markdown-new-styling"><p dir="auto" data-start="0" data-end="51">Yes. Let’s make <strong data-start="16" data-end="42">only the Identity page</strong> for now.</p>
<p dir="auto" data-start="53" data-end="160">For the <code data-start="61" data-end="76">identity.html</code> page, I’ll structure it around your trainer session and the screenshots you shared:</p>
<ol data-start="162" data-end="738">
<li data-section-id="kuxjxs" data-start="162" data-end="193">
<p dir="auto" data-start="165" data-end="193"><strong data-start="165" data-end="193">What is Identity in AEP?</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="2n4fxo" data-start="194" data-end="219">
<p dir="auto" data-start="197" data-end="219"><strong data-start="197" data-end="219">Identity Namespace</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1k27mny" data-start="220" data-end="257">
<p dir="auto" data-start="223" data-end="257"><strong data-start="223" data-end="257">Identity vs Identity Namespace</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="39dcab" data-start="258" data-end="290">
<p dir="auto" data-start="261" data-end="290"><strong data-start="261" data-end="290">Why Identity is important</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1rogael" data-start="291" data-end="408">
<p dir="auto" data-start="294" data-end="326"><strong data-start="294" data-end="326">Create an Identity Namespace</strong></p>
<ul data-start="330" data-end="408">
<li data-section-id="1ub18vp" data-start="330" data-end="344">
<p dir="auto" data-start="332" data-end="344">Display name</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="14cva6w" data-start="348" data-end="365">
<p dir="auto" data-start="350" data-end="365">Identity symbol</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="19tzd9q" data-start="369" data-end="382">
<p dir="auto" data-start="371" data-end="382">Description</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1hil7ta" data-start="386" data-end="408">
<p dir="auto" data-start="388" data-end="408">Select identity type</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li data-section-id="3s8zrg" data-start="409" data-end="583">
<p dir="auto" data-start="412" data-end="455"><strong data-start="412" data-end="455">Identity types shown in your AEP screen</strong></p>
<ul data-start="459" data-end="583">
<li data-section-id="1fdt129" data-start="459" data-end="470">
<p dir="auto" data-start="461" data-end="470">Cookie ID</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1koi9xj" data-start="474" data-end="502">
<p dir="auto" data-start="476" data-end="502">Individual cross-device ID</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1tqowf7" data-start="506" data-end="526">
<p dir="auto" data-start="508" data-end="526">Hardware device ID</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="9pu4u1" data-start="530" data-end="554">
<p dir="auto" data-start="532" data-end="554">Non-people identifiers</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1717an8" data-start="558" data-end="565">
<p dir="auto" data-start="560" data-end="565">Email</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1h37kgn" data-start="569" data-end="583">
<p dir="auto" data-start="571" data-end="583">Phone number</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li data-section-id="12ckp8u" data-start="584" data-end="642">
<p dir="auto" data-start="587" data-end="642"><strong data-start="587" data-end="642">Your trainer's Reliance/Tata-style business example</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="7e1289" data-start="643" data-end="664">
<p dir="auto" data-start="646" data-end="664"><strong data-start="646" data-end="664">Identity Graph</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="xdllq9" data-start="665" data-end="697">
<p dir="auto" data-start="668" data-end="697"><strong data-start="668" data-end="697">Simple real-world example</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="3nyli1" data-start="698" data-end="738">
<p dir="auto" data-start="702" data-end="738"><strong data-start="702" data-end="738">Key points / interview questions</strong></p>
</li>
</ol>
<p dir="auto" data-start="740" data-end="774">For the screenshots, we can place:</p>
<p dir="auto" data-start="776" data-end="853"><strong data-start="776" data-end="793">Screenshot 1:</strong> AEP → Identities → Overview → <strong data-start="824" data-end="853">Create identity namespace</strong></p>
<p dir="auto" data-start="855" data-end="914"><strong data-start="855" data-end="872">Screenshot 2:</strong> Create Identity Namespace screen showing:</p>
<ul data-start="915" data-end="995">
<li data-section-id="1fskl06" data-start="915" data-end="933">
<p dir="auto" data-start="917" data-end="933"><code data-start="917" data-end="933">Re Customer ID</code></p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1ou4jiu" data-start="934" data-end="950">
<p dir="auto" data-start="936" data-end="950"><code data-start="936" data-end="950">recustomerid</code></p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="19tzd9q" data-start="951" data-end="964">
<p dir="auto" data-start="953" data-end="964">Description</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1mb778n" data-start="965" data-end="995">
<p dir="auto" data-start="967" data-end="995"><code data-start="967" data-end="995">Individual cross-device ID</code></p>
</li>
</ul>
<p dir="auto" data-start="997" data-end="1061">And we'll explain each field directly underneath the screenshot.</p>
<p dir="auto" data-start="1063" data-end="1334">I couldn't retrieve the Google Doc itself from the provided URL, so I won't invent anything from the trainer notes. The screenshots you've provided are enough for the AEP UI portion; if you want the <strong data-start="1262" data-end="1285">exact trainer notes</strong> incorporated, upload/export the Google Doc here.</p>
<p dir="auto" data-start="1336" data-end="1426" data-is-last-node="" data-is-only-node=""><strong data-start="1336" data-end="1345">Next:</strong> we should build the actual <code data-start="1373" data-end="1388">identity.html</code> content and then commit it to GitHub.</p></div></div></div></div><div class="z-0 flex min-h-[46px] justify-start"><div aria-label="Response actions" class="touch:-me-2 touch:-ms-3.5 -ms-2.5 -me-1 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-y-4 p-1 select-none -mt-1 touch:w-[calc(100%+--spacing(3.5))] w-[calc(100%+--spacing(2.5))] duration-[1.5s] focus-within:transition-none hover:transition-none touch:pointer-events-auto cant-hover:pointer-events-auto pointer-events-none [mask-image:linear-gradient(to_right,black_33%,transparent_66%)] [mask-size:300%_100%] [mask-position:100%_0%] motion-safe:transition-[mask-position] group-hover/turn-messages:pointer-events-auto group-hover/turn-messages:[mask-position:0_0] group-focus-within/turn-messages:pointer-events-auto group-focus-within/turn-messages:[mask-position:0_0] has-data-[state=open]:pointer-events-auto has-data-[state=open]:[mask-position:0_0]" role="group" tabindex="-1" acrobat-processed-response="Y" style="mask-position: 0% 0%;"><button type="button" class="text-token-text-secondary hover:bg-token-surface-hover rounded-lg" aria-label="Copy response" data-testid="copy-turn-action-button" data-state="closed" acrobat-processed-response="Y"><span class="flex items-center justify-center touch:w-10 h-8 w-8"><div class="[&amp;_svg]:h-full [&amp;_svg]:w-full icon icon"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 20 20" focusable="false" aria-hidden="true"><path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M15.1006 1.78516C16.793 1.78556 18.165 3.15808 18.165 4.85059V10.8838C18.1649 12.5762 16.7929 13.9478 15.1006 13.9482H13.998V15.0508C13.9976 16.7431 12.626 18.1151 10.9336 18.1152H4.90039C3.20789 18.1152 1.83537 16.7432 1.83496 15.0508V9.01758C1.83496 7.32482 3.20764 5.95