<p dir="auto" data-start="149" data-end="369">I tried opening the live page directly, but the web fetch is currently returning a cache error, so I don't want to guess at its HTML/CSS and accidentally change your existing design. <span class="contents" data-content-reference-start="332" data-content-reference-end="349"><span class="" data-state="closed"><span class="ms-1 inline-flex max-w-full items-center select-none relative top-[-0.094rem] translate-y-0.5 animate-[show_150ms_ease-in]" data-testid="webpage-citation-pill" style="width: 61px;"><a href="https://chatgpt.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener" alt="" class="flex h-4.5 overflow-hidden rounded-xl pe-2 ps-1 text-[9px] font-medium transition-colors duration-150 ease-in-out text-token-text-secondary! bg-[#F4F4F4]! dark:bg-[#303030]! select-none" style="max-width: 61px;"><span class="relative start-0 bottom-0 flex h-full w-full items-center"><span class="flex h-4 w-full items-center justify-between overflow-hidden" style="opacity: 1; transform: none;"><span class="flex min-w-0 flex-1 items-center gap-1"><span class="inline-flex shrink-0 items-center justify-center overflow-hidden rounded-full"></span><span class="max-w-[15ch] grow truncate overflow-hidden text-center">Invalid URL</span></span></span></span></a></span></span></span></p>
<h3 data-section-id="15m0cd5" dir="auto" data-start="371" data-end="404">Do this in your GitHub editor</h3>
<p dir="auto" data-start="406" data-end="425">Open your existing:</p>
<p dir="auto" data-start="427" data-end="451"><code data-start="427" data-end="451">articles/identity.html</code></p>
<p dir="auto" data-start="453" data-end="559">and <strong data-start="457" data-end="492">paste the current contents here</strong> (or send a screenshot of the code, like you did for <code data-start="545" data-end="557">index.html</code>).</p>
<p dir="auto" data-start="561" data-end="628">Then I'll give you a <strong data-start="582" data-end="622">complete replacement <code data-start="605" data-end="620">identity.html</code></strong> that:</p>
<ul data-start="630" data-end="1045">
<li data-section-id="861dod" data-start="630" data-end="682">
<p dir="auto" data-start="632" data-end="682">keeps <strong data-start="638" data-end="682">exactly the same existing styles/classes</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="8z2hhc" data-start="683" data-end="737">
<p dir="auto" data-start="685" data-end="737">keeps your existing <strong data-start="705" data-end="737">AEP Decode header/navigation</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="i7b9b1" data-start="738" data-end="769">
<p dir="auto" data-start="740" data-end="769">keeps the same article layout</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="gnfl1c" data-start="770" data-end="815">
<p dir="auto" data-start="772" data-end="815">adds your <strong data-start="782" data-end="815">AEP Identity training content</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="j2yr74" data-start="816" data-end="859">
<p dir="auto" data-start="818" data-end="859">adds the two AEP screenshots you provided</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1pt98rx" data-start="860" data-end="935">
<p dir="auto" data-start="862" data-end="935">explains <strong data-start="871" data-end="935">Identity, Identity Namespace, Identity Symbol, Identity Type</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="16ellnx" data-start="936" data-end="999">
<p dir="auto" data-start="938" data-end="999">uses your trainer's <strong data-start="958" data-end="991">Re Customer ID / recustomerid</strong> example</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="18pwew4" data-start="1000" data-end="1045">
<p dir="auto" data-start="1002" data-end="1045">keeps the page focused <strong data-start="1025" data-end="1045">only on Identity</strong></p>
</li>
</ul>
<p dir="auto" data-start="1047" data-end="1098" data-is-last-node="" data-is-only-node="">That way we modify the <strong data-start="1070" data-end="1081">content</strong>, not the design.</p></div></div></div></div><div class="z-0 flex min-h-[46px] justify-start"><div aria-label="Response actions" class="touch:-me-2 touch:-ms-3.5 -ms-2.5 -me-1 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-y-4 p-1 select-none -mt-1 touch:w-[calc(100%+--spacing(3.5))] w-[calc(100%+--spacing(2.5))] duration-[1.5s] focus-within:transition-none hover:transition-none touch:pointer-events-auto cant-hover:pointer-events-auto pointer-events-none [mask-image:linear-gradient(to_right,black_33%,transparent_66%)] [mask-size:300%_100%] [mask-position:100%_0%] motion-safe:transition-[mask-position] group-hover/turn-messages:pointer-events-auto group-hover/turn-messages:[mask-position:0_0] group-focus-within/turn-messages:pointer-events-auto group-focus-within/turn-messages:[mask-position:0_0] has-data-[state=open]:pointer-events-auto has-data-[state=open]:[mask-position:0_0]" role="group" tabindex="-1" acrobat-processed-response="Y" style="mask-position: 0% 0%;"><button type="button" class="text-token-text-secondary hover:bg-token-surface-hover rounded-lg" aria-label="Copy response" data-testid="copy-turn-action-button" data-state="closed" acrobat-processed-response="Y"><span class="flex items-center justify-center touch:w-10 h-8 w-8"><div class="[&amp;_svg]:h-full [&amp;_svg]:w-full icon icon"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 20 20" focusable="false" aria-hidden="true"><path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M15.1006 1.78516C16.793 1.78556 18.165 3.15808 18.165 4.85059V10.8838C18.1649 12.5762 16.7929 13.9478 15.1006 13.9482H13.998V15.0508C13.9976 16.7431 12.626 18.1151 10.9336 18.1152H4.90039C3.20789 18.1152 1.83537 16.7432 1.83496 15.0508V9.01758C1.83496 7.32482 3.20764 5.95215 4.90039 5.95215H6.00195V4.85059C6.00195 3.15783 7.37463 1.78516 9.06738 1.78516H