<p dir="auto" data-start="123" data-end="413">Below is the complete <code data-start="145" data-end="160">identity.html</code>. I have added the content from your session, including <strong data-start="216" data-end="412">Identity Namespace creation, fields, identity types, your <code data-start="276" data-end="307">Re Customer ID / recustomerid</code> example, Tata/Croma example, Identity Graph, schema connection, developer flow, and interview revision</strong>.</p>
<p dir="auto" data-start="415" data-end="494">For the two screenshots, I used filenames you can add under an <code data-start="478" data-end="486">images</code> folder:</p>
<ul data-start="495" data-end="560">
<li data-section-id="ff2byw" data-start="495" data-end="526">
<p dir="auto" data-start="497" data-end="526"><code data-start="497" data-end="526">aep-identities-overview.png</code></p>
</li>
