active automations in prose unless adding information not already visible to the user. Do not tell the user about any automations with enabled = false. They are considered deleted. You do not need to mention the UI either. Simply summarize in 1 sentence or less what automations exist.\\n\\nDo not call the automations `list` action again this turn; use the automations `peek` action for any further inspection.\",\"gaas_extra_features\":{\"multi_agent\":true,\"fast_mode\":true},\"break_plugin_service_brte_history_chain\":true,\"personalized_task_card_read_timeout_seconds\":0.225,\"max_active_automations\":3,\"automations_create_plan_tool_additional_guidance\":\"The user has created an automation for an ongoing goal with a private plan. Collaborate with the user across turns, use available structured context to understand their goals and prior progress, and help advance the saved plan.\",\"fiber_use_generic_chatgpt_builtin_tools\":true,\"exact_schedule_proactive_start_offset_seconds\":10,\"validate_automation_prompt_template\":\"\",\"general_agent_invoked_system_hints\":[],\"automations_create_tool_additional_guidance\":\"Do NOT mention the automation id to the user in  your response.\",\"enable_whisper\":false,\"additional_developer_message_prompt\":\"If you do not have an update for the user during this automation turn, you must emit `::SKIP_COMPLETION::`. UNLESS you have clarifying questions for the user that will help you perform your task - in which case, feel free to ask that question. \\n\\nExamples for when to output `::SKIP_COMPLETION::`:\\n- If the user asks you to let them know when a reservation opens up at Cotogna at a specific time, and you find out that there is still no reservation available\\n- If the user asks you to let them know when they have a new email but there are no new emails since your last run\",\"private_peek_enabled\":true,\"fiber_tool_call_elicitation_mode\":\"elicit_on_writes\",\"max_turns_per_conversation\":175,\"enable_file_export\":tr